  "description": "A traditional Slovakian stew featuring bamboo shoots and lamination puff, this dish is a unique blend of bitter and snappy flavors, made in a donabe vessel and suitable for satvik diets. It is a hearty one-pot meal that is perfect for a cold evening.",
