  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the donabe vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the bamboo shoots, lamination puff, vegetable broth, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
